  "body": "* 6 bedrooms | 3 bathrooms | 3 separate lounges | 3 garages\r\n* 323sqm house area | 847sqm land area\r\n* Brand-new legal home and income configuration\r\n* Spacious four-bedroom main residence with two living areas\r\n* Separate two-bedroom dwelling with its own kitchen, living and dining\r\n* Three bathrooms across the property, plus two separate laundries\r\n* Internal-access double garage for the main home and single garage for the secondary dwelling\r\n* Generous outdoor space on a substantial 847sqm section\r\n* A versatile option for extended family, guests or additional rental income\r\n\r\nDesigned to offer flexibility without compromising on space, this brand-new Millwater property presents a well-considered home and income opportunity on a generous 847sqm section.\r\n\r\nThe main residence provides four bedrooms and two separate living areas, creating plenty of room for family life and everyday relaxation. At the heart of the home, the spacious kitchen offers generous bench space and storage, flowing naturally into the dining and family living area. A separate lounge provides an additional setting for quiet evenings or entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe main home is complemented by a separate two-bedroom dwelling, complete with its own kitchen, living and dining area, bathroom and laundry. Whether used for extended family, guests or as an income-generating space, this additional accommodation adds valuable flexibility to the property.\r\n\r\nWith a total of six bedrooms, three bathrooms, three separate lounges and three garages, there is plenty of room to accommodate different stages of family life.\r\n\r\nSet within the sought-after Millwater community, this substantial property combines generous proportions with a versatile layout, offering an opportunity to enjoy the space of a large home while having the added benefit of a self-contained secondary dwelling.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
